criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age ≥18 and ≤85 years;
* Diagnosis of moderate/severe asthma according to current Global Initiative for Asthma (GINA) guidelines
* Diagnosis of moderate/severe asthma according to current GINA guidelines and primary arterial hypertension according to current European Society of Cardiology/European Society of Hypertension (ESC/ESH) guidelines
* Patients able to collaborate in the required procedures;
* Signed informed consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* History of asthma exacerbation requiring changing of pharmacological treatment in the previous month.
* Active smoking status or ex-smoker with Pack/Year major than 10;
* BMI major than 30 Kg/m2;
* Pregnancy;
* Diagnosis of concomitant Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD); Obstructive Sleep Apnoea Syndrome (OSA); Clinically significant bronchiectasis; Allergic bronchopulmonary aspergillosis (ABPA); Atopic dermatitis;
* Diagnosis of concomitant Autoimmune Diseases; History of Human Immunodeficiency Virus (HIV), Hepatitis B Virus (HBV), or (Hepatitis C Virus)HCV ;
* Active significant infection
* Malignancy, current or within the past 5 years. Suspected malignancy or undefined neoplasms;
* Cognitive impairment;
* History of clinically significant chronic heart diseases;
